  <section><div class="container narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Draft — not legally approved</p><h1>Website terms (draft)</h1><p class="notice">These draft terms require review by the business owner and legal counsel before launch; they are not an approved legal agreement.</p><h2>Information only</h2><p>Website content and illustrations are general information, not a property listing, binding offer, valuation, legal advice or guarantee of sale. Neighborhood illustrations do not depict official boundaries.</p><h2>Inquiries</h2><p>Submitting a form requests a conversation; it does not create a purchase or brokerage relationship or commit either party to a transaction. Please submit only information you have authority to share.</p><h2>Operator details</h2><p>Legal operator identity, applicable licensing information, contact channel and governing terms must be supplied and reviewed before public launch.</p></div></section>
